      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A patient is described in whom an unstenosed single coronary artery was associated with angina and syncope. Full clinical documentation of the patient with ambulatory electrocardiography, angiography, surgical findings and stress testing before and after bypass grafting are described."},
